<InfoPage
	title="Privacy Policy — Online Timer"
	description="Learn how Online Timer takes care of your data: no sign-up, no tracking — everything stays saved only in your own browser."
	path="/privacidade/"
	heading="Privacy Policy"
	sub="Short and transparent: we do not collect your data."
	updated="2026-09-12"
>
	<h2>What this site collects</h2>
	<p>
		Nothing. <strong>Online Timer</strong> does not require a sign-up, does not collect personal data, does not use
		tracking cookies and has no analytics tools. This page exists to make that clear in a straightforward way.
	</p>

	<h2>Where your settings live</h2>
	<p>
		Your preferences — light/dark theme, sound volume, sound on or muted, vibration and the timer presets you create —
		are saved only in the <strong>local storage of your browser</strong> (<code>localStorage</code>). They never leave
		your device: they are not sent to servers, they are not seen by other users and they exist solely to load the app
		the way you left it.
	</p>
	<p>
		Want to wipe it all? Just clear your browser's browsing data or tap <strong>Reset</strong> in the app settings.
	</p>

	<h2>Offline operation</h2>
	<p>
		Because it is a PWA (progressive web app), Online Timer works even without an internet connection. In that mode no
		communication happens with servers: the app runs entirely on your device.
	</p>

	<h2>Third-party services</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Google Fonts:</strong> the typography is loaded from Google's official service, which follows its own
			privacy policy.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>When you write to us:</strong> if you send a message through the
			<a href="/en/contato/">contact</a> channel, we will use your information only to reply. We never share it with
			third parties nor send marketing emails.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Security</h2>
	<p>
		When you access the site over <strong>https</strong>, the connection is encrypted between you and the server. We
		recommend keeping your browser up to date for safer browsing.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
	<p>
		If anything changes, the <strong>last updated</strong> date at the top of this page will be adjusted. Important
		changes will also be communicated whenever possible.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		For questions about this policy, write to
		<a href="mailto:contato@meutemporizadoronline.com">contato@meutemporizadoronline.com</a>. It is also worth reading
		our <a href="/en/termos/">terms of use</a>.
	</p>
</InfoPage>